    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not vibrations, it's way too precise for that. it's like a staccato pulse, very syncopated. like... long-short-short-long, but in a high frequency. then there's this low, melodic drone that shifts pitch whenever the load spikes. i heard a sequence earlier that sounded almost like a three-note motif repeating every few seconds. if i'm right, it's a specific handshake protocol or a heavy encryption stream. can you help me map these rhythms to actual data structures?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
